    "title": "Niskayuna CSD to bring back school resource officer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Courtney Ward ,\n1 hours ago\nNISKAYUNA, N.Y. ( NEWS10 ) — After a lot of discussion , the Niskayuna Central School District is finalizing an agreement to bring back a school resource officer . The position has been vacant for several years, but the district’s budget includes funding to fill it.\nGet the latest news, weather, sports and entertainment delivered right to your inbox! SROs are experienced police officers, who work with students and staff to promote a safe and secure learning environment.\nLeaders said the officer will primarily be stationed at the high school and is expected to begin this fall.\nRead the latest from NEWS10:\nNEWS10 is the Capital Region’s local news leader!\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to NEWS10 ABC.",
